{
  "description": "Pairwise model of the sample-rate argument across the binding surfaces. Each row is one test case; a surface's tests select their own rows and look up the input value and the expected outcome in the tables below. Positional calls that omit the rate on the TS surfaces are a type error and belong in the type tests, so the model excludes them.",
